{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-freesky-electric-bicycle-540e-2609-0013","content_id":"1bcd866d-9bda-4440-a20e-7ebd4c68277c","description":"Product Safety Report for FREESKY Electric Bicycle presenting a serious risk of fire.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"0e2880e7-61c0-47f0-99a7-4e1cdbc6d8e1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-09-04T15:40:06+01:00","id":"0e2880e7-61c0-47f0-99a7-4e1cdbc6d8e1","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-09-04T15:40:06+01:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ad846f5b35599aec19252/2609-0013-product-safety-report-FREESKY-electric-bicycle.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: FREESKY Electric Bicycle 540E</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures, as the supplied Declaration of Conformity did not match the product.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment – Cycles (Powered)</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>FREESKY</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>540E</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Other Product Identifiers</td>\n      <td>SPA00019C-BK, IB064260515RS-S1-74, M-540E(RANGER) - BLACK, C0411HB50AB0077-22.5</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Plug</td>\n      <td>KONICE/KNC-Y31</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Charger</td>\n      <td>KONICE/KNC-Y31</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Manufacturer</td>\n      <td>Guangzhou Electroy Corporation</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>China</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>An electric bicycle with charger, power supply and accessories.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_0e2880e7-61c0-47f0-99a7-4e1cdbc6d8e1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a9ad846f5b35599aec19252/2609-0013-product-safety-report-FREESKY-electric-bicycle.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>There is no evidence that the product has been assessed using relevant UK conformity assessment procedures as a valid Declaration of Conformity was not supplied. In the absence of evidence to demonstrate the conformity of the product, it may be possible for it to overheat and catch fire. Improvements are also required to the product and charger labelling.</p>\n\n<p>This product does not meet the requirements of the Supply of Machinery (Safety) Regulations 2008.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The import has been rejected at the border.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2609-0013, 2609-0018</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-09-04T14:40:31Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["import-rejected-at-border"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-09-04","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_